WEBVTT

00:00:00.058 --> 00:00:03.262
Try: "I am going to describe the idea in pieces.

00:00:03.506 --> 00:00:05.851
Hold the context until I say done.

00:00:06.293 --> 00:00:10.693
Then repeat back the goal, people, observable journey,

00:00:11.018 --> 00:00:15.813
constraints, verified facts, assumptions, unknowns, and

00:00:15.882 --> 00:00:16.660
non-goals.

00:00:17.171 --> 00:00:18.959
Identify contradictions.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:21.409
Do not choose the architecture yet.

00:00:21.792 --> 00:00:25.170
Wait for my corrections." The prompt is a starting point,

00:00:25.286 --> 00:00:26.447
not magic words.

00:00:26.773 --> 00:00:29.536
The important pattern is that you retain the authority to

00:00:29.617 --> 00:00:31.951
correct the agent's interpretation before an

00:00:32.009 --> 00:00:34.075
interpretation becomes implementation.
